| Task | Rule Type | Why |
|------|-----------|-----|
| find magenta_concrete_powder | position_near_with_facing | This is a find/locate task — the preferred rule is position_near_with_facing (target=pillar center, max_distance=16, facing_tolerance=60°). This correctly models "player can see the target" without requiring them to walk right up to it. |
| mine birch_leaves | inventory_has | Mine task → item ends up in inventory. birch_leaves only drops as an item when mined with shears (which the player has). |
| craft to sugar | inventory_has | Craft task → crafted item ends up in inventory. No other source of sugar exists in the scene. |
| craft to light_blue_carpet | inventory_has | Craft task → crafted item ends up in inventory. No other source of light_blue_carpet exists in the scene. |

